    'Suggest savings by matching verified receipt items against a local benchmark of market prices, refreshed automatically from online stores within the limits each store sets in its robots.txt.',
    'Implement a group workspace with role-based membership, multi-payer expenses and four split methods that always sum exactly to the bill total.',
    'Implement a settlement engine based on the greedy Min-Cash-Flow algorithm that settles a group of V members in at most V − 1 payments, and demonstrate the reduction compared with naive repayment.',
    'Help users save towards personal goals and estimate the zakat due on their wealth, and let groups record trips abroad in foreign currencies, starting in the trip\'s own currency, while all accounting stays in rupees.',
